   $q$The writer wants to add a concluding statement after sentence 14. Which sentence is best?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The goalkeeper wears a shirt that is a different color.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"With special rules, gear and skills, the goalkeeper is the team's last line of defense.","is_correct":true},{"text":"My cousin plays soccer every Saturday morning.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"personal-anecdote-ending"},{"text":"Goalkeepers are more important than all the other players.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$With special rules, gear and skills, the goalkeeper is the team's last line of defense.$q$, $q$This conclusion names the rules, gear and skills from paragraphs 2, 3 and 4 and restates the goalkeeper's job. Saying goalkeepers are more important than everyone is an opinion the report never supports.$q$, 'draft', 'cbf81b78-242c-5149-8a3d-f17c69b09e2f')
